WEBVTT

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.083
<i>Please do forgive me.</i>

00:00:16.542 --> 00:00:20.250
<i>This is an old tale </i>
<i>that began 18 years ago.</i>

00:00:21.042 --> 00:00:24.958
<i>Although for me, of course, </i>
<i>18 years feels like no time at all...</i>

00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:28.667
Behold, isn't it glorious?

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.875
So this is the Black Pearl.

00:00:31.208 --> 00:00:34.792
The jewel that leads to the border
of this world and the afterlife.

00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:37.542
PURVEYOR OF JEWELS – HOSENKI II
Normally it would take 100 years,

00:00:37.542 --> 00:00:40.250
PURVEYOR OF JEWELS – HOSENKI II
but I created it in just four.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.208
This is all thanks to you, Sir Riku,

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:46.292
for allowing me to borrow your
Rainbow Pearl and Lady Izayoi's rouge.

00:00:47.083 --> 00:00:49.417
PIRATE WASHED ASHORE –  RIKU
I'm glad I was able to help you.

00:00:49.417 --> 00:00:51.750
PIRATE WASHED ASHORE –  RIKU
So, what will you do with that?

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:54.375
I plan to deliver it to Sir Inuyasha.

00:00:55.042 --> 00:00:57.792
Well, then, can you please
give him this, too?

00:01:05.792 --> 00:01:09.208
Lady Kaede, I found yet another
remnant of Root Head.

00:01:09.542 --> 00:01:10.833
VILLAGE ELDER PRIESTESS –  KAEDE
Is that so.

00:01:10.833 --> 00:01:14.333
It's been a month,
and we still can't seem to be rid of it.

00:01:14.333 --> 00:01:16.417
Such a troublesome demon.

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:20.250
GYOKUTO AND KIN'U
There's also a demon at Doggy's place.

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:21.792
Do you mean Inuyasha?

00:01:21.792 --> 00:01:24.750
It's a different demon, a shell demon.

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.458
A shell demon?

00:01:26.958 --> 00:01:31.375
Rejoice, Sir Inuyasha!
The Black Pearl is complete.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:35.250
HALF-HUMAN, HALF-DEMON – INUYASHA
And it's ready 96 years earlier than scheduled, too.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.750
I heard a rumor,

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:44.042
but is it true that you inherited my father's
special technique, Adamant Barrage?

00:01:44.458 --> 00:01:46.708
Oh yeah, that's right.

00:01:47.292 --> 00:01:50.750
Please, if you could demonstrate it
for me just this once!

00:01:50.875 --> 00:01:56.458
If you show me, then I shall hand you
this Black Pearl that you so desire.

00:01:56.708 --> 00:01:59.917
Well, if you want to see Adamant Barrage,
then I'll show you.

00:02:00.458 --> 00:02:04.375
Plus, I owe it to the previous Hosenki, after all.

00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:06.542
Oh, thank you, thank you!

00:02:06.917 --> 00:02:07.917
Hey, wait just a second.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.125
Adamant Barrage!

00:02:15.375 --> 00:02:17.208
Inuyasha, sit boy!

00:02:18.167 --> 00:02:20.458
PRIESTESS –  KAGOME HIGURASHI
I didn't think you'd do it here.

00:02:20.458 --> 00:02:22.750
PRIESTESS –  KAGOME HIGURASHI
What were you thinking? Gosh!

00:02:24.042 --> 00:02:32.125
I heard that these were originally the tears
from the Great Dog-Demon's wife, Lady Izayoi.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:35.792
Mother's tears, huh?

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:41.875
When the Great Dog-Demon passed away,
Lady Izayoi's tears were turned into a jewel.

00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:46.458
The Tessaiga and the path to
his grave were sealed inside it,

00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:49.667
and it was placed within
young Sir Inuyasha's right eye.

00:02:50.375 --> 00:02:52.042
Mr. Hosenki, what is this?

00:02:52.333 --> 00:02:55.667
That is the rouge Lady Izayoi used.

00:02:55.750 --> 00:03:01.542
In order to create the Black Pearl,
we needed some of Lady Izayoi's deep sadness.

00:03:01.875 --> 00:03:04.292
I'm surprised you found that.

00:03:04.708 --> 00:03:07.000
It was no easy feat.

00:03:07.875 --> 00:03:11.292
We can have this, too?
Along with the Black Pearl?

00:03:11.292 --> 00:03:15.833
Of course. I have no use for it
now that the Black Pearl is complete.

00:03:16.708 --> 00:03:20.458
Isn't that great, Inuyasha? Now we have
two of your mother's keepsakes.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:24.000
Huh? Why the hell would I
need these things anymore?

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.625
What are you talking about?

00:03:25.625 --> 00:03:28.833
With this, we can go pay respects
to your father's grave.

00:03:29.083 --> 00:03:31.000
Why can't you be happier about it?

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.792
Hmph, like I'd go to somewhere like that.

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:38.542
What have you done?

00:03:38.542 --> 00:03:42.875
Concealing it in your right eye means you
can't extract it unless it's an emergency.

00:03:44.167 --> 00:03:48.583
It was my mother's keepsake,
so I can do whatever I want with it.

00:03:48.583 --> 00:03:53.750
You always say such reckless things.
This rouge is off-limits, okay?

00:03:55.542 --> 00:03:59.292
<i>He's so bad at showing how he truly feels.</i>

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.542
"Farewell Under the Lunar Eclipse"

00:05:49.792 --> 00:05:51.042
Lady Kaede.

00:05:51.042 --> 00:05:52.500
Hurry, hurry!

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:55.083
Oh, Kin'u and Gyokuto, don't rush me.

00:05:55.083 --> 00:05:57.417
But Lady Rin...

00:05:57.417 --> 00:05:58.875
...is about to give birth!

00:05:58.875 --> 00:06:00.167
All right, all right.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:02.708
We're gonna give the baby...

00:06:02.708 --> 00:06:04.792
...way more attention than we give Hisui!

00:06:05.417 --> 00:06:08.208
By the way, where is Sango and Hisui?

00:06:08.625 --> 00:06:11.375
Mother went to get Lady Kagome.

00:06:12.042 --> 00:06:14.375
Kagome, looks like it'll be soon.

00:06:14.375 --> 00:06:15.417
Okay, got it.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.833
MIROKU'S WIFE – SANGO
Are you all right though?

00:06:17.833 --> 00:06:20.292
You're pretty far along, right?
I can't wait.

00:06:21.458 --> 00:06:25.792
Thanks. But I don't have morning sickness,
and you can barely see my bump.

00:06:26.083 --> 00:06:30.167
You're right.
Still, watch your footing, okay?

00:06:34.125 --> 00:06:36.333
Mother! Lady Kaede said...

00:06:36.333 --> 00:06:37.917
...she needs your help with something!

00:06:38.458 --> 00:06:39.958
MIROKU AND SANGO'S SON – HISUI
All right.

00:06:39.958 --> 00:06:44.250
Oh, I'll be fine.
I'll catch up to you, so go on ahead.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.958
Okay. But be careful, okay?

00:06:47.125 --> 00:06:48.125
Yep.

00:06:54.542 --> 00:06:56.042
The moon is waning a little.

00:06:56.542 --> 00:07:00.292
That's odd, it's supposed to be a full moon tonight.

00:07:02.458 --> 00:07:06.208
Oh, right. Tonight must be a lunar eclipse.

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:10.125
The Earth's shadow
covers the moon and it gets dark.

00:07:10.542 --> 00:07:11.708
Lady Kagome.

00:07:13.792 --> 00:07:15.292
My name is Riku.

00:07:15.875 --> 00:07:19.917
Mister Riku? Have we met before?

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.292
No, this is our first time meeting.

00:07:22.292 --> 00:07:24.417
Then how do you know my name?

00:07:25.083 --> 00:07:29.833
The legendary priestess who made
the right wish and purified the Shikon Jewel.

00:07:30.333 --> 00:07:35.333
Word of your deeds has spread much further
than you can imagine, you know.

00:07:35.667 --> 00:07:38.708
Is that so.
So do you have business with me?

00:07:39.542 --> 00:07:42.208
A great cataclysm is approaching.

00:07:43.125 --> 00:07:48.583
Every 500 years, a comet called
the Grim Comet travels close to this Earth.

00:07:49.542 --> 00:07:50.583
A comet?

00:07:51.458 --> 00:07:57.000
Unfortunately, large fragments
break off and fall from that Comet.

00:08:00.208 --> 00:08:04.958
500 years ago, back when nobles
were governing the land,

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:09.750
war and famine kept spreading,
and many people died.

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:13.750
Because of that,
the population of demons grew.

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:18.417
And great demons who controlled them
appeared in the East and West.

00:08:19.167 --> 00:08:22.875
You know one of them quite well—
the Great Dog-Demon.

00:08:23.417 --> 00:08:26.500
The Great Dog-Demon...
Inuyasha's father.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.500
Yes, that's correct.

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:31.167
The Great Dog-Demon and Kirinmaru.

00:08:31.625 --> 00:08:33.875
These two Beast Kings joined forces

00:08:34.125 --> 00:08:37.875
and eradicated the Comet
fragment 500 years ago.

00:08:38.958 --> 00:08:42.000
Inuyasha's father did? Oh, wow...

00:08:42.458 --> 00:08:44.250
Seven days from now,

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:48.500
the Grim Comet's fragment
will fall upon this Earth once again.

00:08:49.375 --> 00:08:52.792
However, the Great Dog-Demon is no longer,

00:08:52.792 --> 00:08:55.792
and Kirinmaru himself
has fallen into a long slumber.

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:59.083
Will Inuyasha be able to serve
in his father's place?

00:08:59.375 --> 00:09:01.667
How can we awaken Kirinmaru
from his slumber?

00:09:02.167 --> 00:09:04.875
I don't recommend awakening Kirinmaru.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:08.417
He hates humans and cannot forgive
the existence of half-demons.

00:09:09.458 --> 00:09:11.708
He wouldn't just kill Inuyasha.

00:09:11.708 --> 00:09:16.917
He would also most likely kill the half-demon
that Lady Rin will birth tonight.

00:09:17.625 --> 00:09:20.542
And, of course, your child as well.

00:09:21.917 --> 00:09:23.583
He'll kill my child?

00:09:24.792 --> 00:09:26.458
Can't we do anything?

00:09:26.458 --> 00:09:31.333
Isn't there a way to destroy the Comet's
fragment while keeping Kirinmaru asleep?

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.833
There is one way.

00:09:34.292 --> 00:09:38.583
If the Great Dog-Demon's sons
can combine their strength, and...

00:09:39.167 --> 00:09:42.083
If there's anything I can do, I'll do it!

00:09:42.667 --> 00:09:47.500
Then, can you please convince
Lord Sesshomaru and Lord Inuyasha?

00:09:47.958 --> 00:09:50.208
Okay, I'll see what I can do.

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.583
INUYASHA'S OLDER HALF-BROTHER –
SESSHOMARU

00:09:56.958 --> 00:09:58.625
SESSHOMARU'S VASSAL – JAKEN
Lord Sesshomaru,

00:09:58.625 --> 00:10:00.208
looks like they're born.

00:10:04.458 --> 00:10:06.333
Hm? Who goes there?

00:10:07.417 --> 00:10:10.583
BEAUTIFUL MYSTERY DEMON – ZERO
It's been a while, Lord Sesshomaru.

00:10:11.917 --> 00:10:15.667
Just who are you?
Come, answer my question!

00:10:16.458 --> 00:10:18.667
How is your mother doing?

00:10:18.667 --> 00:10:21.375
Hmph, I haven't seen her in years.

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:26.250
Word is that you had twins.
Or was it <i>half-demon </i>twins?

00:10:28.167 --> 00:10:31.417
I can already picture the surprise
on Kirinmaru's face.

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:35.042
The great Lord Sesshomaru,
known to despise humans and half-demons...

00:10:35.042 --> 00:10:39.042
...has taken a human woman as his wife.

00:10:40.375 --> 00:10:45.167
Perhaps you should hide your precious
daughters  before he awakens.

00:10:45.167 --> 00:10:48.333
Is it not you who wants them dead, Zero?

00:10:48.333 --> 00:10:51.542
Oh my, you remembered my name?
I'm flattered.

00:10:58.417 --> 00:10:59.583
A puppet?

00:10:59.667 --> 00:11:00.667
How boorish.

00:11:01.583 --> 00:11:06.833
Once the lunar eclipse ends, the Grim Comet
will approach for the first time in 500 years.

00:11:07.542 --> 00:11:10.667
You should use your Bakusaiga then.

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:15.583
It's your choice whether to heed
my warning or not, Lord Sesshomaru.

00:11:16.167 --> 00:11:20.542
However, as someone humiliated by your father...

00:11:20.542 --> 00:11:25.375
I'd be lying if I said I didn't wish to
see your entire family suffer in agony.

00:11:26.583 --> 00:11:29.417
Well then, best of luck to you.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.083
Just who does she think she is?

00:11:34.208 --> 00:11:36.708
Huh? L-Lord Sesshomaru!

00:11:39.542 --> 00:11:41.875
You did well, Rin.

00:11:42.417 --> 00:11:44.125
TOWA AND SETSUNA'S MOTHER – RIN
Thank you very much.

00:11:44.125 --> 00:11:45.625
TOWA AND SETSUNA'S MOTHER – RIN
Really, they're both so adorable.

00:11:45.625 --> 00:11:47.417
Really, they're both so adorable.

00:11:47.458 --> 00:11:48.667
What will you name them?

00:11:50.583 --> 00:11:52.833
Towa and Setsuna.

00:11:53.417 --> 00:11:58.750
Towa and Setsuna, huh?
Yes, those are wonderful names.

00:12:01.333 --> 00:12:02.625
Lord Sesshomaru.

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:09.417
What are you doing?

00:12:09.417 --> 00:12:12.917
You fool,
where do you plan to take them?

00:12:12.917 --> 00:12:15.125
Sesshomaru, what's going on?

00:12:15.792 --> 00:12:17.917
It's a rite of courage and cowardice.

00:12:18.708 --> 00:12:20.000
Wait, Sesshomaru.

00:12:21.125 --> 00:12:24.333
Is Kirinmaru tied to this somehow?

00:12:25.292 --> 00:12:27.667
In order to destroy the Comet's fragment,

00:12:27.667 --> 00:12:31.167
I heard that we need both
you and Inuyasha.

00:12:37.625 --> 00:12:41.542
Lord Sesshomaru, I have faith in you.

00:12:43.583 --> 00:12:44.917
Hey, Kagome.

00:12:45.583 --> 00:12:46.625
Jaken.

00:12:46.958 --> 00:12:54.417
I wrote here when and where Lord Sesshomaru
plans to destroy the Comet fragment.

00:12:54.667 --> 00:12:58.167
Naturally, Lord Sesshomaru
can fulfill the task on his own,

00:12:58.167 --> 00:13:01.292
but we're letting Inuyasha know just in case.

00:13:01.292 --> 00:13:03.083
Oh, okay. Got it.

00:13:04.125 --> 00:13:05.208
Master Jaken.

00:13:06.625 --> 00:13:08.708
Leave the rest to me.

00:13:13.958 --> 00:13:15.875
LEADER OF THE KA DEMONS – JOKA
Zero asked me to do this.

00:13:15.875 --> 00:13:19.708
Hand over those half-demon twins to me!

00:13:31.958 --> 00:13:33.542
Rainbow Pearls, huh.

00:13:33.958 --> 00:13:37.792
Give those back!
They're the jewels of the Ka Demon Tribe!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:42.042
No. These are Zero's tears.

00:13:55.708 --> 00:14:01.875
This Jaken shall fulfill the role of
their caretaker and raise them in Rin's place.

00:14:07.958 --> 00:14:10.542
Jaken, Jaken!

00:14:11.042 --> 00:14:13.458
Come forth, barrier!

00:14:23.333 --> 00:14:28.625
The barrier is complete.
I shall eventually bring Rin here, too.

00:14:48.958 --> 00:14:52.250
I can't sense the presence
of those half-demon twins anywhere.

00:14:52.833 --> 00:14:56.750
Looks like they were sealed away
within a barrier somewhere.

00:14:57.583 --> 00:14:59.875
As expected from Sesshomaru.

00:15:09.375 --> 00:15:12.292
This palace belongs to
Lord Sesshomaru's mother.

00:15:12.583 --> 00:15:17.042
But it doesn't look like she's here today.
Thank goodness...

00:15:25.708 --> 00:15:26.792
It's here.

00:15:41.667 --> 00:15:43.208
Bakusaiga!

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:50.542
And the rest...

00:15:50.542 --> 00:15:52.750
Leave that to me.

00:15:55.792 --> 00:15:59.125
Meido Zangetsuha!

00:16:09.208 --> 00:16:11.625
Wonderfully done, Lord Sesshomaru.

00:16:12.542 --> 00:16:14.417
I'm the one who cleaned it up!

00:16:14.792 --> 00:16:17.292
Yes, Inuyasha, you did well, too.

00:16:17.833 --> 00:16:19.375
What are you saying?

00:16:19.375 --> 00:16:24.208
Your Meido Zangetsuha originally
belonged to Lord Sesshomaru.

00:16:24.625 --> 00:16:25.625
Jaken.

00:16:26.375 --> 00:16:28.500
– We're leaving.
–  Y-Yes.

00:16:30.583 --> 00:16:32.417
Kagome, let's go!

00:16:32.417 --> 00:16:34.083
Hey, wait for me.

00:16:38.208 --> 00:16:40.958
Why have you awoken me?

00:16:41.583 --> 00:16:43.750
BEAST KING –  KIRINMARU
The Great Dog-Demon's sons

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:46.792
must have taken care of
the Comet's fragment.

00:16:47.958 --> 00:16:54.208
Sesshomaru has taken a human as a bride.
Just like the Great Dog-Demon did...

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:55.708
He did <i>what?</i>

00:16:56.125 --> 00:17:01.208
At this rate, Sesshomaru will be plunged
into disaster and fall to ruin.

00:17:01.667 --> 00:17:03.333
Are you going to let that happen?

00:17:03.875 --> 00:17:08.458
And he has sired daughters.
Half-demons twins.

00:17:10.375 --> 00:17:11.500
Do you remember?

00:17:12.208 --> 00:17:18.375
The Shikon Jewel is gone now,
but it still left us a prophecy.

00:17:20.417 --> 00:17:21.500
Kirinmaru.

00:17:22.125 --> 00:17:26.542
You will be felled by an existence
that is neither human nor demon.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:30.833
An impossible entity that can surpass time.

00:17:30.833 --> 00:17:33.375
That is what will defeat you.

00:17:34.083 --> 00:17:38.000
You laughed it off,
saying no such thing can exist,

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.625
but thanks to the Great Dog-Demon,

00:17:40.292 --> 00:17:44.083
that which should not exist
has become reality.

00:17:44.625 --> 00:17:46.542
That is the half-demon.

00:17:47.333 --> 00:17:50.625
They are an existence
that is neither demon nor human.

00:17:51.167 --> 00:17:55.250
And a quarter demon daughter
will soon be born between Kagome,

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:59.375
the girl who surpassed time to
appear in this world, and Inuyasha.

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:05.250
And if we can't erase these cursed half-demons
and abominable quarter-demon...

00:18:06.875 --> 00:18:11.375
Just as the Shikon Jewel prophesized,
you will meet your end.

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:21.125
Lord Sesshomaru.

00:18:21.125 --> 00:18:23.875
It's been a while, Kirinmaru.

00:18:25.625 --> 00:18:28.000
Will you slay Inuyasha?

00:18:28.375 --> 00:18:30.250
That's what I had in mind.

00:18:30.958 --> 00:18:34.750
Could it be that Lord Sesshomaru
is going to lend a hand?

00:18:36.042 --> 00:18:40.083
Very well. Come with me, Sesshomaru.

00:18:44.417 --> 00:18:46.667
You're such a good child.

00:18:47.208 --> 00:18:48.500
Kagome!

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:50.292
They're here!

00:18:50.292 --> 00:18:51.292
Okay.

00:18:56.542 --> 00:18:59.292
This is a keepsake from Inuyasha's mother.

00:19:00.917 --> 00:19:05.000
We decided that if we had a girl,
we would give this to her.

00:19:09.458 --> 00:19:12.042
Mr. Hachi, please take care of her.

00:19:20.125 --> 00:19:22.000
We will never hand over Moroha to you!

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:24.083
Quit your prattling, human.

00:19:27.667 --> 00:19:28.625
Inuyasha!

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.000
Inuyasha, are you okay?

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:33.000
Yeah.

00:19:37.167 --> 00:19:38.167
Kagome!

00:19:40.208 --> 00:19:41.417
Kagome!

00:19:43.792 --> 00:19:45.125
You helped them?

00:19:45.125 --> 00:19:46.458
What are you talking about?

00:19:47.292 --> 00:19:48.750
Lord Kirinmaru.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:54.458
There will come a time when
Inuyasha's Meido Zangetsuha will be needed.

00:19:54.958 --> 00:20:00.125
Until then, I think we should simply
have them pay respects to the Master's grave.

00:20:01.542 --> 00:20:02.875
I suppose that's fine.

00:20:06.542 --> 00:20:10.667
<i>I'm glad the Black Pearl and </i>
<i>Lady Izayoi's rouge were useful.</i>

00:20:24.917 --> 00:20:26.917
Look at them dream...

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:33.125
Thanks to the Dream Gazing spell,
I've finally found them.

00:20:35.875 --> 00:20:36.875
Homura.

00:20:37.333 --> 00:20:39.708
Burn that forest down.

00:20:39.708 --> 00:20:41.542
That forest?

00:20:41.542 --> 00:20:43.000
That's fine by you, right?

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:44.458
Lord Sesshomaru?

00:20:51.042 --> 00:20:56.750
Burn the entire forest, and erase those cursed
half-demon sisters from the face of this world.

00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:58.208
Understood.

00:21:03.375 --> 00:21:04.958
Setsuna, this way.

00:21:08.458 --> 00:21:10.875
Sis!

00:21:13.875 --> 00:21:15.958
Setsuna? Setsuna!

00:21:16.375 --> 00:21:17.667
Sis...!

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:21.000
Are you okay? I'm sorry I ran off like that...

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:25.500
Look out!

00:21:32.208 --> 00:21:33.208
Oh, no!

00:21:34.750 --> 00:21:36.208
Setsuna!

00:21:36.292 --> 00:21:38.167
Sis!

00:21:38.167 --> 00:21:40.083
Where'd she go?

00:21:40.625 --> 00:21:41.208
Setsuna!

00:21:41.208 --> 00:21:44.750
<i>And thus, Lady Towa, </i>
<i>Lord Sesshomaru's daughter,</i>

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:47.458
<i>departed on her trip beyond time.</i>

00:21:50.667 --> 00:21:53.208
<i>This is as far as I can divulge.</i>

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:04.083
Come on now, don't be hasty.
It's in poor taste, you know?

00:22:04.083 --> 00:22:05.083
Oh!

00:22:06.458 --> 00:22:09.083
If fate allows it,
perhaps we shall meet again.

00:22:09.583 --> 00:22:11.417
Until then, farewell.

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:44.458
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:44.458 --> 00:23:48.292
You threw that child into
the crucible of Kodoku?

00:23:48.292 --> 00:23:50.542
She's got a fifty-fifty chance of surviving.

00:23:50.542 --> 00:23:54.083
Hey, Yawaragi.
Our master-pupil relationship ends today.

00:23:54.083 --> 00:23:56.000
I'll have you hand over Kurikaramaru.

00:23:56.333 --> 00:23:59.958
It was a shock to hear that Moroha
got sold off by her master.

00:23:59.958 --> 00:24:03.292
But why is she hanging with
Konton, one of the Four Perils?

00:24:03.542 --> 00:24:06.542
Next time on <i>Yashahime:</i>
<i>Princess Half-Demon</i>: "Double-Edged Moroha"

00:24:06.542 --> 00:24:23.979
I won't need any help.
This is between my master Yawaragi and me.
